/**
 * requestFacets.heldout6.spec.ts — sixth facet set: COMPUTED-VALUE phrasing
 * (Copilot standard-setup retest, 2026-10-02). 64 items (40 EN + 24 JA; 24
 * value positives phrased with return/result/output/compute/calculate/
 * evaluate, 24 hard negatives using the same words for callers/condition/
 * flow/change requests, 16 mixed) generated by EVO-X2 in a fresh context over
 * 12+ domains, with identifiers from the measured fixtures banned. Labels
 * adjudicated by the orchestrator BEFORE scoring (en-08, en-34, ja-18: value
 * required, condition only tolerated -- the "when/if" is an input, not an
 * asked condition; en-21: a rename request names no facet, callers
 * tolerated).
 *
 * THIS IS A DEVELOPMENT SET, NOT A BLIND ONE. Scored first against the
 * pre-change extractor (value recall 0.33, precision 1.00), its misses then
 * shaped requestFacets.ts's VALUE_COMPUTED_* frames (the "what ... does X
 * compute/output/hand back", "calculate what X returns/gives" and JA
 * <code>の結果/出力 arms). Final: value recall 0.95 / precision 1.00; the two
 * remaining value misses (ja-19, ja-24) say 戻り値, which the held-out-guided
 * return-value guard deliberately keeps out. condition/callers/flow are
 * unchanged by the frames. The blind check of the same change is
 * requestFacets.heldout7.spec.ts.
 *
 * Floors are a regression guard just under that result, not a target.
 */
